# ==============================================================================
# observability-sandboxes-aws-datadog — root .gitignore
# Applies to every topic folder (a1-...  through a10-...), since patterns below
# with no leading slash match at any depth in the repo.
# ==============================================================================

# --- Internal tags (see project plan: Tagging - Values & File Strategy) ---
# Populated per-topic with the generic internal_tags map (owner/team/purpose,
# or whatever keys you choose). Never committed — keeps both the tag values
# AND the tag key names private, since this repo is public.
tags.auto.tfvars

# --- Terraform local state & working files ---
# Not relevant here since every topic uses the HCP Terraform remote backend
.terraform/
.terraform.tfstate.lock.info
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfstate.backup

# --- Terraform CLI credentials / crash logs ---
.terraformrc
terraform.rc
crash.log
crash.*.log

# --- Terraform override files (used for local, temporary overrides) ---
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json

# --- Plan output files (if ever saved locally, e.g. `terraform plan -out=tfplan`) ---
*.tfplan
*.plan

# --- Any other local/secret var files (defense in depth beyond tags.auto.tfvars) ---
*.secret.tfvars
secrets.auto.tfvars

# --- OS-specific files ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# --- Editor/IDE files ---
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp

# ==============================================================================
# NOTE: .terraform.lock.hcl is intentionally NOT ignored — it's a provider
# dependency lock file and should be committed per Terraform's own guidance,
# so anyone cloning a topic's folder gets the same provider versions.
# ==============================================================================
